<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-SOUTH AFRICA A BEAT WESTERN COUNTIES.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-SOUTH AFRICA A BEAT WESTERN COUNTIES.</headline>
<dateline>EXETER, England 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa A beat Western Counties 62-20 in a rugby union tour match on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
